2 CONT *[S1074] ''Ancestors of American Presidents'', Gary Boyd Roberts, (Name: Carl Boyer, 3rd, Santa Clarita, CA, charts by Julie Helen Otto, published in cooperation with the NEHGS, Boston, MA 1995; Location: Chesebro' Reference Mater
2 CONC ial;), page 1.
2 CONT *[S90] ''Genealogies of Virginia Families Volume I, English Ancestry of Col. William Ball of Millenbeck'', Peter Walne, Berkshire County, Archivist, Reading, England, (Name: 1981; Location: Chesebro' Reference Material;), pages 16
2 CONC -22.
