2 CONC ington D.J. French, "The English ancestry of George Washington's mother, Mary Ball - a history of the Balls of Berkshire, Northamptonshire and Virginia," 2013. Mary Ball Washington, in "Genealogy and Ancestry of Barack Obama and o
2 CONC ther U.S. Presidents," (Blog). Rev. Horace Edwin Hayden, Virginia Genealogies, Wilkes-Barre, Pennsylvania (1885), pp. 56 - 59.
