1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===William Ball, of "Millenbeck"===
2 CONT * Birth:	1676 - Virginia
2 CONT * Death:	Mar 1744/45 - Virginia
2 CONT * Parents:	William Ball, Margaret Williamson
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT William Ball married before 1692 to Hannah Heale (daughter of George Heale / Haile and Ellen Rogers).
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children:
2 CONT * 2 William BALL , Jr. b: abt. 1697 d: bef Apr 1741 + Margaret BALL b: abt 1704 d: Oct 1783 
2 CONT * 2 George BALL b: ABT. 1699 + Judith ? 
2 CONT * 2 Sarah BALL b: ABT. 1701 + Abram BARNES + Dennis MCCARTY 
2 CONT * 2 Judith BALL b: ABT. 1703 + George GLASSCOCK d: 1796 
2 CONT * 2 Ellen BALL b: ABT. 1705 + Richard CHICHESTER d: BEF. 1747 + William DOWNMAN 
2 CONT * 2 Margaret BALL b: ABT. 1707 
2 CONT * 2 Richard BALL b: ABT. 1709 
2 CONT * 2 Hannah BALL b: ABT. 1711 
2 CONT
