2 CONT <p>[g675.ftw]</p><p><p></p></p><p>Hayden, (Virginia Genealogies, p. 65) Joseph Ball's son was Spencer Ball, whose son was Spencer Mottrom Ball, whose daughter married William Roane, father of the great jurist Spencer Roane.
