2 CONC heirs. Nephew Joseph Chinn in VA, 20 pounds. 10 Sept. 1750. Witn.: Eliz. Moore, Peter Newman, Rich. Newman. Proved in P.C.C., 27 March 1760 by Frances wife of Rawleigh Downman, the daughter of dec'd and sole exec."
