2 CONT Children (Ball wills):
2 CONT * -96. i. Richard, m. —, 1752, Mary Wallace.
2 CONT * 97. ii. Williamson, d. in 1769; m. —, Priscilla Glasscock, dau. of Win. Glasscock, prob. Capt. Wm., who m. Esther Hall, No. 32. Priscilla m. (II.) Aug. 18, 1769 (L.) Mungo Henry, and had James and John Henry. By her first marria
2 CONC ge she had—i. Alice, m. John Smith, ii. Williamson.
2 CONT * 98. iii. Benjamin, d. s. p. (v. will of William Ball) before 1783. -+- 99. 
2 CONT * 99. iv. William, m. (I.) --; m. (II.) 1740 (?) Lettice Lee.
2 CONT * 100. v. Elizabeth, b. —; m. Dec. 9, 1754. Francis Milner (l.), Wm. Ball, security. Had Margaret, Betty, Hannah.
2 CONT * 101. vi. Sarah, d. s. p.; m. —, John Jones.
