2 CONT #  "Biography of Abraham Barnes": p 114 in Papenfuse, Edward C. et. al. ''A Biographical Dictionary of the Maryland Legislature, 1635-1789.'' (Johns Hopkins University Press: Baltimore, 1979) [http://aomol.msa.maryland.gov/000001/
2 CONC 000426/html/am426--114.html Maryland Archives Online]
