2 CONC  Hackley was a lieutenant in the Rev. War.  Made his will March 16, 1799:  probated June 15, 1799 Culpeper Co., V a;  F.  Samuel Hackley;  H.  Judith Ball Hackley married Thomas Jameson, brother of James.
2 CONT
