2 CONT  Father: Samuel Henry BALL  b: 26 Sep 1686 in Lancaster County, Virginia  Mother: Anna Catherine TAYLOE  b: 1688 in Mount Airy House, Richmond County, Virginia  Marriage 1 John HACKLEY b: Bef 1720 in King George County, Virginia
