2 CONC  unty History", p. 61], John Hackley (d. 1760; will, King Geo. Co.; 1769 e state, Culpeper Co., VA, Will Book A:476); 8 chdn. [20 Jan. 1980 letter , Peggy Stein to Eastwick]. Judith's will, Culpeper Co., VA Will Book B: 80."  Birt
