1 NOTE ABSTRACTS LANCASTER CO., VA WILLS - 1653-1800 compiled by Ida J. Lee, p. 111
2 CONT HEALE, William   Ap(praisal) and Division  8 July 1737  Rec. 3 Sept. 1737
2 CONT Joseph Chinn, Gent. & Priscilla His wife for her part of her late husband, Mr. Wm. Heale's estate   W. B. 13, p. 24
2 CONT Note:  This certainly shows that Priscilla was widow of William Heale and wife to Joseph Chinn. - JMC
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 101
2 CONT He Married May 2, 1727, Lancaster Co., Mrs. Elizabeth Ball, Joseph Chinn and George Payne signing the bond.
2 CONT Mr. Chinn gave bond as Sheriff, Lanc'r Co., 1730-9; was Justice of the Co., 1734; Vestryman of Christ Ch., Lanc'r Co., 1739-1751; Church Warden, 1751-1 (Parish Records); Burgess for Lanc'r 1748, 1752, 1754, when he resigned.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 101
2 CONT Joseph Chinn of Lancaster Co., VA. died Jan. 28, 1754 (Overwharton Records).
