2 CONT 1. Born in 1734 according to Stella Pickett Hardy, "Colonial Families of the Southern States of America: A History and Genealogy of Colonial Families Who Settled in the Colonies prior to the Revolution," Baltimore, MD: Southern Bo
2 CONC ok Co., 1958.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Born in 1738 according to The Washington Bible, transcribed by Tracy St. Claire.
