1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Dr. George Glascock''' was born on December 20, 1742 in Farnham, Richmond County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34667773817 Capt. William Glascock] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-346
2 CONC 89642188 Esther (Ball) Glascock]. He was a surgeon, County Clerk. 
2 CONT
2 CONT George married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34667773523 Martha (Patsy) (Howard) Glascock]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34667773780 John Melton Glascock, Sr]; [https://www.geni.com/profi
2 CONC le-34702231090 Mary Polly (Glascock) Muse]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34702231092 Martram Glascock]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34702231093 Elizabeth (Glascock) Muse]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on October 18, 1787 in Robbins, Moore County, North Carolina, United States from murdered by Phillip Alston 's slave  and was buried in 1787 in Glascock Family Cemetery, Carthage, Moore County, North Carolina, United State
2 CONC s. 
2 CONT ----
