1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Washington Ball left South Carolina with his family as a six month old baby to come to Fayette County, Indiana.  He was raised and lived his entire life in Fayette County south of Connersville.  He married E
2 CONC lizabeth Jane Hood whose family had been even earlier pioneers in Indiana.
