1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT === Judith Ball
2 CONT * FamilySearch Family Tree
2 CONT * Birth:	1753 - Bewdley, Lancaster, Virginia, British Colonial America
2 CONT * Death:	Jan 30 1817 - Essex, Virginia, United States
2 CONT * Parents:	James Ball Jr., Letrice Ball (born Lee)
2 CONT * Spouses:	Leroy Griffin, Captain John Fauntleroy
2 CONT
2 CONT Children include: 
2 CONT # Elizabeth Griffin
2 CONT # Judith Griffin
2 CONT # Lettice Lee Brockenbrough (born Fauntleroy)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1653-1800 Lancaster County, Virginia Wills [Ida J. Lee];
2 CONT BALL, James. Will. 3 Sep. 1789. Rec. 21 Dec. 1789.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gr. Dau. Mary Edwards, negroes purchased of her father, Mr. Thos. Glascock, and after the death of her husband Maj. Leroy Edwards, to be divided between James Ball McCarty and Mildred Smith McCarty her half brother and sister. 
2 CONT Gr. sons: James Ball (500 a. land) Jesse Conway, John Smith and William Ball sons of son Jesse Ball. 
2 CONT Son James Ball land purchased of Burges Smith, adjoining Jesse Conway and Capt. Richard Selden's mill, containing 150 acres. 
2 CONT Daus. Mildred Selden, Sinah Beale, '''Judith Fauntleroy''', Ann Ball, Frances Lee and Sarah Ball. Son James Ball, Extr. No witnesses. W.B. 22, Page 117.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===
2 CONT 1653-1800 Lancaster County, Virginia Wills [Ida J. Lee];
2 CONT
2 CONT SELDEN, Mildred (of Richmond Co.) 29 Mar. 1793. Rec. 16 Sept. 1793.
2 CONT Sisters: Sinah Beale, Judith Fauntleroy, Ann Ball, Sarah Fauntleroy, Frances Lee. 
2 CONT Nieces: Ann Ball, dau. of brother Col. Jesse Ball & Louisa Fauntleroy. 
2 CONT Brother: Col. James Ball. 
2 CONT Nephews: William Ball, son of Col. Jesse Ball, James Ball McCarty, Wm. Henry Fauntleroy. 
2 CONT Ex: James Ball. Wits: Fanny Ball, Fanny McCarty, Mary W. Ball. W.B. 22, Page 394.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
