1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 111
2 CONT Col. Burgess Ball was born at "Traveller's Rest," Spotsylvania Co.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #1 - Ibid
2 CONT He married by Rev. William Douglas, July 2, 1770, Mary Chichester.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR #2 - Ibid
2 CONT He married 2nd Frances Washington April 7, 1781.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He died at "Springwood," Friday, March 7, 1800, "precisely at 12 o' lock in the day, after a long and painful illness which he bore with fortitude and peity; aged 50 years, 7 mos. and 7 days." (F.B.)  His will was probated Dec. 8,
2 CONC  1800.
2 CONT
