1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Spencer Mottram Ball
2 CONT * Birth:	Sep 9 1736 - Northumberland County
2 CONT * Death:	Dec 1786 - Northumberland County
2 CONT * Parents:	Spencer Ball
2 CONT * Siblings:	Judith Ball, Mary Ball, James Ball, William Ball, Jesse Ball, Elizabeth Ball
2 CONT * Spouse: 1) Judith Jones 2) Elizabeth Catesby Waring
2 CONT
2 CONT ===notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=thamm&id=I13350
2 CONT
2 CONT Col. Spencer Mottrom Ball, son of Spencer Ball, lived at "Coan" Northumberland county; was burgess in 1769-1771 and 1772-1774; resigned in 1773 to accept the office of sheriff. He was one of the signers of the Westmoreland Associa
2 CONC tion against the Stamp Act. He married Elizabeth Waring, daughter of Col. Francis Waring, of "Goldberry", Essex county. He died in Nov or Dec 1786. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Virginia Biography pg 177-178.
2 CONT
2 CONT *27 Feb 1766: Signer of the Leedstown Resolutions. Historical Atlas of Westmoreland Co. VA, pg 16. He was a Burgess from Northumberland Co. and signed the "Association at Williamsburg" June 22, 1770. in 1773 he was sheriff of Nort
2 CONC humberland Co.
2 CONT *31 Aug 1769: Deposition of Col. Spencer Mottrom Ball, age 33 years. Recorded 18 May 1770, Lancaster Co. VA. That sometime after the marriage between Winder Kenner and the despondent's sister Mary, daughter of the late Col. Spence
2 CONC r Ball, regarding her dower, etc.
2 CONT *1770: BALL, SPENCER M., Married Elizabeth, daughter of Francis Waring Book W 12, Page 432. Index to Marriages of Old Rappahannock and Essex Counties, Virginia, page 15.
2 CONT ===Links
2 CONT * http://www.wikitree.com/genealogy/Ball-Family-Tree-1287
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://books.google.com/books?id=yeWgvfDpwbwC&lpg=PA795&ots=4YNZOML5oZ&dq=Joseph%20ball%20mary%20Spencer&pg=PA795#v=onepage&q=Joseph%20ball%20mary%20Spencer&f=false Lewis of Warner Hall: ] The History of a Family.  Page 795 "Ba
2 CONC ll Family."
2 CONT *Helen Ramey genealogy
2 CONT * Virginia Genealogies (Genealogical Publishing Co., Inc. Baltimore, 1979
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Capt. Spencer Mottrom Ball
