2 CONT * Siblings:	Judith Ball, William Ball, Elizabeth Judith Ball, Jesse Ball, James Ball, Elizabeth Betty Ball
2 CONT * Wife:	Elizabeth Ball (born Waring)
2 CONT * Children:	Spencer Mottrom Ball, Elizabeth Ball, Lucy W. Ball, William I. Ball, Judith Ball, Henry Waring Ball, Anne Ball
