2 CONC ancestors of Travers emigrated from England to Northern Neck, Va., in 1640&apos;s. The obituary of Travers Daniel, Senior, Esquire, appears in the Fredericksburg Virginia Herald of 17 July 1824 in the Library of Congress. From 176
