2 CONT
2 CONT The Wikipedia profile for Fielding Lewis shows that his son Samuel Lewis was born on 14 May 1762 and died on 31 December 1810.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT The website for the George Washington Foundation shows that Samuel was born on 14 May 1763 and died 31 December 1774.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Alternative death : Samuel Lewis; b. May 14, 1763; d. Sep 3, 1764 at age 1[3]
