1 NOTE !BIRTH - THE WASHINGTONS AND THEIR HOMES by John W. Wayland, p. 324
2 CONT George Steptoe Washington (1774?-1809), son of Col. Samuel and his 4th wife, Anne Steptoe (Widow Allerton).  George Steptoe lived at Harewood, the home of his father, Col. Samuel Washington.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid
2 CONT He married Lucy Payne, sister to Dolly Payne Todd (later Madison) about 1793; lived at Harewood in Jefferson Co.,VA/WV.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - MARRIAGES AND DEATHS FROM BALTIMORE NEWSPAPERS, 1796-1816 by Robert Barnes, p. 338
2 CONT WASHINGTON, George S., of VA., died 16th ult. in Augusta, nephew of the late Pres. Washington, in his 37th year.  Interment in St. Pauls Churchyard.  (Balto. American, 14 Feb 1809)
