1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Mildred Washington was born about 1760 (another source has 1769) in Bushfield, Westmoreland Co., VA. She died about 1797.
2 CONT
2 CONT * parents: Daughter of John Augustine Washington & Hannah Bushrod. 	
2 CONT Married
2 CONT # 13 Oct 1788 Westmoreland County, Virginia to Thomas LEE (AFN: 8MRN-JG).  He was the son of 	Richard Henry LEE (AFN:8MRN-98)  & Anne AYLETT (AFN:8MRN-H9).  Thomas was born on 20 Oct 1758 in Westmoreland, VA. He died on 7 Sep 1805
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT * One source lists her middle initial as C.  One source has it as W.
2 CONT
