1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for VIRGINIA with the rank of SECOND LIEUTENANT.  DAR Ancestor #: A121961 
2 CONT
2 CONT Another nephew, George Augustine Washington, son of the 1st President's younger brother Charles by a cousin, Mildred Thornton, managed the Mount Vernon estate during his uncle's first term as President. He married Martha Washingto
2 CONC n's favourite niece, Fanny Bassett, but died in 1793, whereupon George Washington invited Fanny to stay on at Mount Vernon. He also offered to educate their eldest surviving son, George Fayette Washington. 
2 CONT
2 CONT George served as an ensign during the Revolutionary War, and was a member of the Commander-in-Chief Guards.
2 CONT
