1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Samuel Washington''' was born in 1765 in Westmoreland Co, VA. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-77780506 Col. Charles Washington] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-28811162 Mildred Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-26035358 Dorothea Washington] in 1795 in Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26036353 Mildred Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26036414 Samuel Thornton Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26036446 August C Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26036475 George Fayette Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26034794 Francis Augustine Washington, Sr.]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 10, 1831, in Kanawha, Virginia. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000154150890821]
2 CONT  Connecticut, Hale Collection of Cemetery Inscriptions and Newspaper Notices, 1629-1934 for Samuel Washington Connecticut Newspaper Notices Vol 18 Link to probated Will [ https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000154143551
2 CONC 821]
2 CONT
2 CONT  [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/111701831/person/432205426326/facts] One of the earliest settlers of the Fort Tackett area, Samuel was instrumental in the first surveys and opening the area up to settlement.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel was the son of Charles Washington and Mildred Thornton. He was the husband of Dorothea Thornton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mildred Ann Washington 1797- 1799
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Thompson 1806-1869 m. Wilhelmina Hudson
2 CONT
2 CONT Augusta Clifford Washington
2 CONT
2 CONT George Fayette Washington m. Frances Garten m.Mary McGraw
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis Augustine Washington m. Melvina Garten
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/120997733/samuel-t.-washington Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 3 2020, 21:20:33 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
