1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Burgess, daughter of Charles Burgess and Frances Fox, was born 1732 in St Mary's White Chapel Parish, Lancaster County, Virginia, and died there between 1754 and 1758.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married twice.
2 CONT # Jeduthan Ball (1725-5 May 1749) - married 1748 at St. Mary's White Chapel, Lancaster County, Virginia.  He was the son of James  Ball and Mary Conway, and her stepfather's brother.
2 CONT # Robert Armistead (abt 1712-1767) - married 1750 at Lancaster County.  He was the son of Henry Armistead and Martha Burwell.  He married 2ndly to Anne Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Jeduthan Ball and Elizabeth Burgess:
2 CONT * 	1. Burgess Ball,   b. 28 Jul 1749, St. Mary's White Chapel, Lancaster County, Virginia Find all individuals with events at this locationd. 7 Mar 1800, Loudoun County, Virginia (Age 50 years)  [Father: natural]
2 CONT *  	2. William Ball,   b. Bef 1749, Virginia Find all individuals with events at this locationd. Aft 1791, Bromfield Parish, Culpeper County, Virginia (Age > 44 years)  [Father: natural]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.colonial-settlers-md-va.us/getperson.php?personID=I40309&tree=Tree1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Charles Burgess and Frances Fox:
2 CONT * 1. Frances Burgess,   b. Abt 1718, St Mary's White Chapel Parish, Lancaster County, Virginia d. 1750, Lancaster County, Virginia.  Married Baldwin Matthews Smith.
2 CONT *  	2. Margaret Burgess,   b. Abt 1721, St Mary's White Chapel Parish, Lancaster County, Virginia.  Married James Ball (1718 - 1789), son of James Ball and Mary Conway.
2 CONT *  	3. Elizabeth Burgess,   b. 1732, St. Mary's White Chapel, Lancaster County, Virginia d. Between 1754 and 1758, St. Mary's White Chapel, Lancaster County, Virginia. Married 1) Jeduthan Ball (1725-1749), son of  James Ball & Mar
2 CONC y Conway 2) Robert Armistead.
2 CONT
