2 CONT
2 CONT GEORGE BALL CUSTER (b: 3 December 1744 PA d: 17 December 1829 PA) married SUSANNAH LONG (b: 13 May 1755 Bakers Lookout, Washington, Md d: 17 October 1784 PA) daughter of JOHN LONG and ANNA CATHERINE STUDEBAKER on 29 March 1774 in 
2 CONC Washington, MD (2) CATHARINE LEATHERMAN (b: 7 Apr 1767 Hagerstown, Frederick, MD d: 22 Sept 1844) daughter of DANIEL LEATHERMAN and MARIA KATARINA BOYER on 28 Nov 1784 MD. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George and Susannah:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. JOHN CUSTER (b: 21 December 1774 MD d: 8 November 1843 OH) m: Susanna Grossnickle 2. GEORGE CUSTER (b: 30 July 1776 MD) m: Mary Wise 3. SARAH CUSTER (b: 16 Jan 1778 MD d: 1874 OH) m: James Fouch 4. DANIEL CUSTER (twin) (b: 17 F
2 CONC ebruary 1780 MD) 5. DAVID CUSTER (twin) (b: 17 February 1780 MD d: 15 Nov 1857) 6. JACOB CUSTER (b: 13 March 1782 PA d: 23 June 1820 OH) m: Elizabeth (Betsy) Leatherman 7. HANNAH CUSTER (b: 11 August 1784 PA) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George and Catharine: 
