1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lewis (Louis) W. Reno BIRTH	1789 Prince William County, Virginia, USA DEATH	1863 (aged 73–74) Greenville, Hunt County, Texas, USA BURIAL	 Bettes Cemetery Bonham, Fannin County, Texas
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/11413636
2 CONT
2 CONT He married MARY LUCINDA "POLLY" SHROPSHIRE140 June 02, 1813 in Harrison Co., KY daughter of JAMES SHROPSHIRE and MILDRED DICKERSON. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His parents were; Zeley Reno and Mary Lela Chinn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Christened at Silas Run Baptist Church, Bourbon Co., KY on 28 September 1811. Baptism record mentions his wife Polly. . 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was probably born between 1775 and 1780 and married before 1801 since he had a son and two daughters born before 1804, but his marriage record from Harrison Co. has him marrying Polly Shropshire in 1813,
2 CONT
2 CONT Their Children were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Sarah Elizabeth7 Reno, b. December 11, 1813, Muhlenberg Co., Kentucky; d. Bef. 1870, Fannin Co., Texas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Frances Lucinda Reno, b. January 01, 1817, Muhlenberg Co., KY; d. May 27, 1845, Palmyra, Marion Co., MO. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Mildred Reno b. Aft. 1813, Muhlenberg Co., Kentucky; m. Samuel Hawkins, June 08, 1834, Palmyra, Marion Co., MO; b. Abt. 1797, Shenandoah Co., Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Lewis Henry Reno, b. 1825, Kentucky; d. 1859, Greenville, Hunt Co., Texas; buried Forest Park Cemetery. 
2 CONT
2 CONT v. William Charles Reno, b. 1827, Kentucky; d. April 11, 1868, Hunt Co., Texas. 
