1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 116
2 CONT Capt. George Washington was born March 20, 1789 in Loudoun Co.,VA and bp. May 3, 1789.  Sponsors: Wm. Glassell, Francis Thornton, Jr., Robert Lewis, Mrs. Moffat, Elizabeth Thornton, Eliza B. Ball.  He is said to have been a large 
2 CONC and remarkably handsome man, of great popularity, and and at his death, widely mourned.  
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He died single in 1815.
2 CONT
2 CONT INDEX TO LOUDOUN CO.,VA WILLS, 1757-1850 by Louisa Skinner Hutchison, p. 52
2 CONT BALL, BURGESS, F:226, 1800
2 CONT Son George Washington is named in will.
