1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 136
2 CONT He was born at "Coan", Northumberland Co., VA in 1767.
2 CONT He was educated at Universities of Glasgow and Edinburgh, at the first of which he graduated M.D.  Began practice in North'd Co., in 1790.  In 1814 his property being destroyed by the British, he left North'd Co and located in Fai
2 CONC rfax Co.  Was eminent in his profession and universally beloved; was an earnest Christian and a lay delegate to the Council of the Protestant Episcopal Church in VA., 1815.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid
2 CONT He married Jan. 25, 1800, Martha Corbin Turberville.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT Died "Woodbury", Fairfax Co., VA Aug. 23, 1842.
