1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1.	Christopher Dameron I (Bartholomew Dameron5, Christopher Dameron4, Bartholemew Dameron3, Lawrence Dameron2, George Dameron1) was born ABT 1757 in Virginia, and died 1810/08 in Caswell Co., North Carolina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah "Sally" Ingram ABT 1774, daughter of John Ingram and Hannah Pines. (?)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Christopher Dameron I and Sarah "Sally" Ingram are:
2 CONT *+	2	  i.	Anne Morehead "Nancy" Dameron was born 1765/1777/1770 in Brunswick, VA, and died ABT 1840.
2 CONT * 	3	  ii.	John Dameron died 1803. He married Mary Clay 18 JAN 1800 in Person Co., North Carolina. She was born 1777 in Person Co., North Carolina.
2 CONT * 	4	  iii.	Sally Dameron died 1855. She married Charles Matthews, son of James Matthews and Anne. He died 1781 in Brunswick Co., VA.
2 CONT * 	5	  iv.	Christopher Dameron II was born ABT 1799, and died ABT 1843. He married Salley Ware 6 JUN 1815. He married Martha A. Camron.
2 CONT *	6	  v.	Bartholomew Dameron was born 1775, and died 25 FEB 1847 in Randolf Co., MO. He married Rebecca Malone 27 AUG 1798, daughter of Daniel Malone and Elizabeth Staples.
2 CONT * 	7	  vi.	Mary "Polly" Dameron died 1842. She married Robert W. Jackson 27 SEP 1808 in Caswell Co., North Carolina.
2 CONT *	8	  vii.	Catherine Dameron died 1818. She married William Dameron 5 DEC 1814 in Caswell Co., North Carolina, son of Joseph Dameron and Mary Harrison Burton. He was born 1791. She married UNKNOWN Malone.
2 CONT * 	9	  viii.	Martha "Patsy" Dameron. She married Johnson McDaniel. She married ? Anderson.
2 CONT * 	10	  ix.	Patience Dameron. She married Daniel Jackson.
2 CONT
