2 DATE 24 SEP 1762
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fredericksberg
3 STAE Virginia
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1836
2 PLAC Clermont, OH
2 ADDR
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HISTORY of CLERMONT COUNTY. OHIO, with Illustrations and Biographical Sketches of its PROMINENT MEN AND POINEERS, 1880 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1800, Richard Taliaferro was employed by General James Taylor to sell lands for him in the neighborhood of Boston. In 1802 he brought his family from Kentucky and settled on a farm now owned by Jacob Balshizer. He was twice mar
2 CONC ried; his first wife was a Davis*, by whom he had five children, - Zack, Lucy, Jones, Matilda, and Emily. His seconf wife was Rebecca Riddle, by whom he had six children, -Jefferson, Sarah, Elizabeth, Kitty, Riddle, and William. R
2 CONC ichard Taliaferro wqas a native of Caroline C0., Va. He was under George Rogers Clark in his memorable expedition against Vincennes and Kaskaskia in 1778. 
2 CONT
2 CONT           *           *          *
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Taliaferro died in 1835, while on a visit to Ohio, and was buried on his son's farm, he having previously removed to Indiana. In person he was fine looking, of medium height, and stoutly built. Thomas Bragg, a distant rela
2 CONC tive* of Richard Taliaferro, settled about the same time on the farm now 
2 CONT
2 CONT the property of Valentine Snider. His family consisted of his wife and five children, -Richard, Mary, Elizabeth, Nancy, and Rebecca. He enlisted in the war of 1812 and was killed at the battle of the River Raisin. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes:  Davis* - actually was Sarah Jones relative* - his brother-in-law 
1 FAMC @F6000000000591594174@
1 FAMS @F6000000007498269336@
1 FAMS @F6000000007498169449@
1 RFN geni:6000000007498050822
1 SUBM @S6000000000591388342@
1 NOTE Second wife of Richard Taliaferro was Rebecca Riddle and their children were: Jefferson Taliaferro, born July 18, 1801; James Riddle b. abt 1800; Sarah; Kitura, Elizabeth, and William
2 CONT From William C. Fleenor Sept 08, 2000.
2 CONT Common Pleas Minutes for Years Nover Term 1835 to April Term 1837 page 424 (April Term 1837)
2 CONT "Satisfactory evidence was this day produced in open Court that Richard Taliaferro was a revolutinary pensioner of the United States that he resided in Clermont County in the State of Ohio next before his death, that he died in sa
2 CONC id County on the second day of January A.D. 1837 that he left no widow and left Jones Taliaferro, Zachariah Taliaferro, Matilda Parks, Sarah Ewing, Elizabeth McClelland, Jefferson Taliaferro, Riddle Taliaferro, Rebecca Scarlatt, L
2 CONC ucy Peak and Emily Hammes his children.
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Richard TALIAFERRO was born 24 SEP 1762 in Fredericksburg,Culpepper,Virginia, and died 1836 in ,Clermont,Ohio. He was the son of  Peter  and  Annie HACKLEY
2 CONT
2 CONT Sara JONES  was born Abt 1762 in <Cynthiana,Lincoln,Kentucky>. She was the daughter of 14. John JONES .
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sara JONES and Richard TALIAFERRO are:
2 CONT 	i.	Jones TALIAFERRO was born 10 FEB 1796 in ,Lincoln,Kentucky, and died 27 DEC 1880 in ,Laclede,Missouri. He married Eliza C. TOWNSLEY  1817 in ,Clermont,Ohio, daughter of Edward Or Edmund TOWNSLEY and Esther TOWNSLEY. She was bo
2 CONC rn 13 OCT 1799 in ,,Pennsylvania, and died 13 FEB 1880 in ,Laclede,Missouri.
2 CONT 	ii.	Emily TALIAFERRO was born 1795 in ,Lincoln,Kentucky. She married David MARTIN . He was born Abt 1791 in <,Lincoln,Kentucky>. She married HAMMERS . He was born Abt 1791 in Lincoln Co Kentucky.
2 CONT 	iii.	Zachariah TALIAFERRO  was born 1790 in ,Lincoln,Kentucky, and died 1818. He married Nancy MALOTT . She was born Abt 1794 in <,Lincoln,Kentucky.
2 CONT 	iv.	Matilda TALIAFERRO  was born 24 SEP 1793 in ,Lincoln,Kentucky, and died 28 JAN 1875 in ,Clermont,Ohio. She married David PARKE  20 MAR 1817, son of John PARKE and Lettice MOSLEY. He was born 2 FEB 1795 in Lincoln Co Kentucky,
2 CONC  and died 31 MAR 1853.
2 CONT 	v.	Lucy TALIAFERROwas born MAY 1788 in ,Lincoln,Kentucky.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 2 Rebecca (Riddle) RUDDELL
2 CONT  b: 18 Nov 1772 in Bourbon Co.,Ky 
2 CONT Married: Aug 1799 in Harrison Co.,Ky
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT SARAH TALIAFERRO  b: 17 MAR 1804 in CYNTHIANA,KY 
2 CONT JEFFERSON TALIAFERRO b: 18 JUL 1801 in CYNTHIANA,KY 
2 CONT JAMES RIDDLE TALIAFERRO  b: 1800 in CYNTHIANA,KY 
2 CONT KITURA TALIAFERRO 
2 CONT ELIZABETH TALIAFERRO b: 26 APR 1807 in CLERMONT CO,OHIO 
2 CONT WILLIAM TALIAFERRO
2 CONT NANCY TALIAFERRO
