1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nellie Sturgeon House is listed as owning land in Jasper County, Illinois, in 1847.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT [Marriage Records, Barren Co., KY]  a.k.a Barron Co., KY
2 CONT
2 CONT "Know all men by these presents that we Michael House and Gambril Cox are held and firmly bound unto his Exclly Christopher Greenup, Esqr, Governor of the State of Kentucky and his Successors in the sum of fifty pounds current mon
2 CONC ey which payment well and truly to be made, we bind ourselves and our heirs jointly and severally by these presents sealed with our Seals and dated this 15th day of February 1805.
2 CONT
2 CONT MICHAEL HOUSE.
2 CONT
2 CONT TESTS: W LOGAN       GAMBRILL COX his order.
2 CONT
2 CONT M Hous and Nelly Sturgeon Feby 15, 1805.. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir you will pleas to grant lisons for Michal Hous for I James Sturgeon do give up my daughter Nelli Sturgeon with my own free good will to the said Michal Hous this given under my hand this 15th day of February 1805..
2 CONT
2 CONT TEST: JOHN DICUS.
2 CONT
2 CONT ABRAHAM GOODRIM       JAMS STURGEON."
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------
2 CONT Birth is listed as 1788 in some places; 1785 in others.
