2 CONT ----
2 CONT The below information is for James 'Barton', Sr. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I've personally found NO traceable connections to the Bratton family and would love to see original sources to prove the Bratton line is correct. [D.B.]
2 CONT
2 CONT A land transaction for a James Barton with wife Rebecca in Laurens District, SC before the 1790 census was taken. James wasn't in the 1790 census of Laurens District, but several Barton heads-of-house moved from Laurens to Pendlet
2 CONC on by the 1790 census.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1790 Pendleton District, SC
2 CONT
