1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT From [http://rareed0001.wordpress.com/2013/05/18/just-what-is-a-cloud-thrasher-and-why-is-david-oldham-bartons-son-one-of-them/ Just what is a Cloud Thrasher?]
2 CONT
2 CONT >"Susan Barton married John Thrasher. John Thrasher was surrounded by Cloud Thrasher’s growing up – he had brothers Isaac Cloud Thrasher and Joseph Cloud Thrasher and a mother, Ruth Cloud who had married into his happy little Thra
2 CONC sher family. I suspect, not having seen a middle name for John that he could have even been given the Cloud middle name. Apparently David Oldham and Peggy Barton liked old John Thrasher and honored him by naming their son after hi
2 CONC s family and from then on the Barton family had Cloud Thrashers in it."
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/historyofthrashe00thra#page/n7/mode/2up A history of the Thrasher family]: traced through the eighteenth and nineteenth centuries in England and America, by Marion Thrasher. Published 1895 by M. Thras
2 CONC her in San Francisco, Calif . Written in English.
2 CONT
2 CONT links
2 CONT * http://www.oocities.org/wi4r79/pafg10.htm#349
