2 CONT Parents: John Moncure & Ann Conway; Wife: Sarah Elizabeth Henry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: i. Henry Wood MONCURE was born 12 JUL 1800 in Richmond, VA ii. John James MONCURE was born 1802 in VA, and died 1827 in New Orleans, LA. iii. Sarah MONCURE was born 1804, and died 1811. iv. Robinson MONCURE was born 1807
2 CONC  in VA, and died 1829 in New Orleans, LA. v. Edwin Robinson MONCURE was born 13 FEB 1808, and died 20 NOV 1810. vi. Henry Lee MONCURE was born 24 JAN 1814 in VA, and died 23 AUG 1815 in VA. vii. Charles Prosser MONCURE was born 2 
2 CONC APR 1819 in Stafford Co., VA, and died 3 JAN 1887 in Orange Co., VA. Buried Graham Cemetery, Orange, Orange Co., VA.
