2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/93072089/bushrod_washington
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Born at the "Haywood Plantation" Westmoreland County, Virginia April 4, 1785 4th Child of William Augustine and Jane (Washington) Washington, and Husband of Henrietta Brayne (Spotswood) Washington and died at "Mount Eagle" 
2 CONC Fairfax County, Virginia April 16, 1831 Bushrod Washington is buried in an Unmarked plot in Mount Vernon Estate along with a few of his other children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Bushrod Washington, II:
2 CONT
