1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Francis Augustine Washington, Sr.''' was born on February 22, 1811, in West Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-26035186 Samuel Washington] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-26035358 Dorothea
2 CONC  Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34760083625 Malvinia Washington Born M Garten]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34760083629 Francis Augustine Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34760083630 Dorothy A Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854881 Pvt. (USA), Prince William Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34649806145 Melvina Washington]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-25989221 Francis  (Frank) Augustine Washington, Jr.]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on August 8, 1872 in Mason, Mason, West Virginia, United States and was buried after August 4, 1872 in West Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
