2 CONC Leonidas "Lee" 1832-1888/TX m: Elizabeth Hungerford -Lucretia 1834-1868 m: William Beaman -Hamilton abt 1836 m: Hannah Hungerford -Cecia S. 1838-1857 unmarried -Junus Brutus 1840-1858 -Margaret Ann 1842-1922 unmarried -John L 1844
