2 CONT
2 CONT WARREN, James b: Aug 22 1801, Kentucky d: Jan 7 1888, Lucas, Henry Co, MO bur: Mullin Cemetery, White Oak Twp, Henry Co, MO Death of an old Settler - James Warren, who died at his home in Lucas, in the early part of January, was a
2 CONC  very old and respected citizen of Henry county, having come here about 30 years ago settling in Tebo township. He came from Cooper county. From Tebo township he removed to White Oak, locating in the neighborhood of Lucas where he
2 CONC  has lived for about 20 years until his death. His age was about eighty-seven and death was brought on through the infinities of old age. His remains were interred in the Mullin cemetery. 
2 CONT
