1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Aged 62yrs 6mo.
2 CONT William Ridgely Wilmott, was born in October 1814 in Bourbon County, KY. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married''' Elizabeth Graves''' and 7 children were born before Elizabeth died about 1858. Then on May 3, 1868 he married '''Nancy Cunningham''' and they had 3 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth and William's children that are not listed are: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Malinda D Wilmott, married William Dunlap, 
2 CONT Matilda Wilmott married George M Dunlap, 
2 CONT Alice Wright Wilmott FAG# 55590281 married William F Cunningham FAG# 55590251, 
2 CONT Prucilla Susan Wilmott b 09 Aug 1851- 19Mar 1903 married James Jackson Brock,
2 CONT Milton Wilmott, did not live a year. 
2 CONT James Mackhatten Wilmott married Mollie Ann Miller.
2 CONT Grave Perry Wilmott married Mary Susan Graves.
2 CONT
2 CONT The 3 chidren from Nancy and William are: 
2 CONT Eliza Horner Wilmott FAG# 75454466 married George D Parrott, 
2 CONT Charles R Wilmott 23 Dec 1871- 22 Jul 1932, never married and 
2 CONT Laura Belle Wilmott 19 Apr 1876-2 Nov 1952 married James P Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
