2 CONT Richard Chichester Mason, M.D. married Lucy, dau. of Col. Robert Randolph, Fauquier Co., of William Randolph, 1651-1711 and his wife Eliza(beth) Carter, 1764-1832, dau. of Charles Carter of Shirley, and his wife, Mary W. Carter, o
2 CONC f Cleve. 
2 CONT See A GENEALOGY OF THE KNOWN DESCENDANTS OF ROBERT CARTER OF COROTOMAN compiled and published by Florence Tyler Carlton, p. 14
2 CONT
