2 _PRIM Y
1 NOTE !BIRTH - JOHN ALEXANDER, A NORTHERN NECK PROPRIETOR, HIS FAMILY, FRIENDS & KIN by Wesley E. Pippenger, p. 363
2 CONT Edgar Vaux Weir of "Liberia" near Manassas, Prince William Co. was born 11 Dec 1836.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - PRINCE WILLIAM CO., VIRGINIA RESIDENTS - MARRIAGES FROM SOURCES OUTSIDE THE COUNTY by Ronald Ray Turner, p.82
2 CONT Weir, Edgar V.. 24, Prince Wm. son of William J.. & Harriet B. to Eugenia M. Alexander 21, Fairfax, dau. of Robert and Eliza A. 26 Sep 1862 Fauq.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - See Birth Reference
2 CONT He died 4 Dec 1911 at Manassas.  
2 CONT "Liberia" was built in 1829 by William J. Weir and wife Harriet Bladen Mitchell, the latter inheriting the tract from her mother Priscilla Carter, great-granddaughter of Robert "King" Carter.
