1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From The Public Ledger from Maysville, Kentucky, from Sept. 25, 1914:
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral this morning
2 CONT
2 CONT The funeral for Mrs. Nancy D. Tolle, who died at her home in Forest Avenue, Tuesday morning, was held from her late home this morning at 10 o'clock, sun time, with services by Rev. A.F. Stahl. Burial in Maysville Cemetery.
