1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In 1848 James Creth Burt married '''Frances Anne Gibson''', born April 1818 in Culpepper Courthous, VA. She was the widow of Rev. John Mallory Welch of Virginia and a very beautiful woman. Her parents were Col. Cat
2 CONC lett Gibson and Martha Dandridge Ball of Virginia. Frances was descinded through her mother from Charles Washington, brother of our first president George Washington. They had three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Eustice Pierre Burt,
2 CONT # John J. Burt and
2 CONT # Anna Burt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Frances had one daughter,
2 CONT # Martha "Mattie" Dandridge Welch, from her first marriage.
