1 NOTE VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 308-309
2 CONT John William Bronaugh and Ann Eilbeck McCarty had Eliza Bronaugh.  She was born 1811 in Georgetown from whence her parents moved to Stafford Co.,VA.  She early was confirmed in the P.E. church of which she was a communicant for ne
2 CONC ar 60 years.  
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - THE LIBRARY OF VIRGINIA - HENLEY MARRIAGE & OBITUARY DTABASE: CATALOG CARD - VIRGINIA HERALD (FREDERICKSBURG, VA.)
2 CONT Married in Stafford Co., on Thursday, Oct. 8, by Rev. Edw. C. McGuire, Thomas H. C. Daniel, to Miss Eliza Mason Bronaugh, daughter of the late John W. Bronaugh.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT She died Oct. 22, 1889, prob in Richmond, VA as they moved to Richmond, VA in 1861. (Obit. Southern Church)
