1 NOTE !VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 140
2 CONT Col. Spencer Mottrom Ball was born Feb. 24, 1804.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - GENIUS OF LIBERTY 1817-1843 by M. Hiatt, A. Hennings & P.B. Doncan, p. 80
2 CONT Married on the 7th inst. by Rev. Dr. Keith, Major Spencer M. Ball of Fairfax and Mary L. Dulany, daughter of Daniel F. Dulany, Esq. of Oak Mount, Fairfax Co., VA.
2 CONT Note:  Married 7th May, 1833. - JMC
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He died April 21, 1859, probably in Fairfax Co., VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1850 census of Fairfax Co., VA taken 28 Aug. 1850, p. 132, Dwelling #344, Family #344 lists Spencer M. Ball as a clerk in D.C. with $9,600 of real estate,  Upton H. Dulany is a student.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ball, Spencer M.             48   b/VA
2 CONT                Mary L.          37     VA
2 CONT          Rebecca F.           10     VA
2 CONT            William N.(?)         3     VA
2 CONT              James M.            1     VA
2 CONT Foote, Ann                    57     VA      
2 CONT Dulany, Upton H.            23     VA
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:  Upton H. Dulany may be Mary L Ball's brother.  Ann Foote is unknown. - JMC
