1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Hayden, p. 140
2 CONT Lucy Elizabeth born Aug. 16, 1791.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid, p. 140
2 CONT Married March 5, 1807 William Fitzhugh Carter, Fairfax Co.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - HISTORY IN A HORSESHOE CURVE by Elizabeth H. Johnson, E.R. Conner,
2 CONT III & Mary H. Ferguson, p. 40
2 CONT Mrs. Carter died at "Mountain View" on January 20, 1855 and was interred beside her husband in the Sudley House lot.
2 CONT
2 CONT !BURIAL - Ibid
2 CONT There doesn't seem to be a stone for her in photocopy of stones in the Sudley
2 CONT House Cemetery. - JMC
2 CONT As it says on photocopy:  This is a large burying ground but many of the
2 CONT stones have been carried away and put to other uses and many of those that
2 CONT remain are too broken to read.
2 CONT She was the daughter of Spencer Ball and Elizabeth Landon Carter who was
2 CONT daughter of Robert Carter of Nomini Hall.
