1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA LINEAGES, LETTERS & MEMORIES by Alice Jean Nelson, 1984, P.
2 CONT 116
2 CONT Alfred Ball born 19 April 1798 at "Cancer Farm", Prince Wm. Co., VA
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid
2 CONT Married 27 May 1828 Sally Caroline Carter, daughter of Landon Carter, Esq. of
2 CONT Woodland.
2 CONT LOUDOUN CO.,VA MARRIAGE RECORDS TO 1881 compiled by Aurelia M. Jewell
2 CONT Alfred Ball & Sarah C. Carter - 27 May 1828 by Joseph White, pastor of M.E. Church, Leesburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT Alfred Ball died 14 March 1853 at Portici where he and wife are buried in the
2 CONT old Ball Graveyard.
2 CONT
2 CONT !BURIAL - PRINCE WILLIAM CO., VA. BURIAL INDEX 1800-1993 compiled by Ronald
2 CONT Ray Turner, Cemetery #87
2 CONT Buried in Ball Cemetery/Portici - 1/2 mile N. of Vandor Lane, Access road along north side at I-66 East of Sudley Rd., unimproved lane connecting Vandor Lane with Lee Hwy. Route 29/211 runs 200' west of cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred Ball inherited Portici (762 acres) from his mother, Betty Landon
2 CONT (Carter) Ball when she died in 1842 (will dated 9 Apr 1841).
2 CONT When he died, Portici passed to his sisters and widow.
2 CONT Sarah C. Ball, widow of Alfred Ball, was allotted, as her dower, the said part of the real estate of the said Alfred Ball.  The balance of the real estate was divided into 4 parts.  One part was allotted to Louisa (Ball) Weir, wif
2 CONC e of William J. Weir, one part to Elizabeth (Ball) Carter, wife of
2 CONT William Fitzhugh Carter, one part to Frances "Fanny" T. (Ball) Lewis, wife of
2 CONT Rev. John T. Lewis and one part to Adeline (Ball) Best, wife of Henry Best.
2 CONT VIRGINIA LINEAGES, LETTERS AND MEMORIES by Alice Jean Nelson, p. 6-7
2 CONT
2 CONT PRINCE WILLIAM CO., VA. 1850 AN ANNOTATED CENSUS compiled by Ronald Ray Turner, p. 9.
2 CONT Family #185 lists Alfred Ball as head of family, a farmer with $40,000
2 CONT property.  His wife, Sally is daughter of Landon and Courtney Carter.  Lettie
2 CONT Ball (Lettice) was unmarried daughter of Henry Waring Ball who was Alfred's
2 CONT uncle and Charlott Ball was his aunt (father's half-sister).  Hebe Armistead is unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ball, Alfred     51    b/VA
2 CONT       Sally      45      VA
2 CONT       Lettie     45      VA
2 CONT       Charlott   32      VA
2 CONT Armistead, Hebe  43      VA
