2 CONC 1860, 1870) _FA1: Sep 1850, In Fed Census as Jones Tallifero, Clay Co., Richland Dist., IL _FA2: 1850 Census: age 54 b KY _FA3: Jun 1860, In Fed Census as Jones Taliafero, Clay Co., Twp 2N R 5E, Xenia PO, IL _FA4: 1860 Census: age
2 CONC  65 b KY _FA5: 30 Jun 1870, In Fed Census as Jones Taliferro, Laclede Co., Osage Twp., MO _FA6: 1870 Census: age 74 b KY  Father: Richard TALIAFERRO  b: 24 SEP 1762 in Fredericksburg, Culpepper Co., VA  Mother: Sarah JONES b: 1762
2 CONC   Marriage 1 Eliza Cooper TOWNSLEY  b: 13 OCT 1799 in Cambell Co., KY and died 13 FEB 1880 in Dry Knob, Laclede Co., MO. She was buried in Ketechtky-Talliferro Cemetery, Dry Knob, Laclede Co., MO. She was the daughter of 6. Willia
2 CONC m TOWNSLEY  and 7. Mrs. Martha TOWNSLEY 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 23 AUG 1817 in Hamilton Co., OH
2 CONT Children of Eliza Cooper TOWNSLEY and Jones T. TALIAFERRO are: 
2 CONT 1.	i.	Richard TALIAFERRO  was born 11 AUG 1818 in Clermont Co., OH, and died OCT 1872 in IL. He married Jane "Jennie" STANLEY 22 JUN 1850 in South Middleport, Iroquois Co., IL, daughter of Micajah STANLEY and Rebecca MOORE. She wa
2 CONC s born 12 FEB 1834 in Milford, Iroquois Co., IL, and died 3 JUN 1915 in Watseka, Iroquois Co., IL. 	
2 CONT 	ii.	Marion TALIAFERRO  was born 1 MAY 1820 in OH, and died 10 NOV 1848 in Clark Co., OH. He married Eve Ann BUFFENBARGER11 NOV 1841 in Clark Co., OH, daughter of George Washington BUFFENBARGER and Mary Hannah HOOSE. She was born 
2 CONC 1819-1820 in Madison Twp., Clark Co., OH, and died AFT 1849 in (last known residence Clark Co., OH). 	
2 CONT 	iii.	Martha TALIAFERRO  was born 20 JAN 1822 in OH (Clermont Co., probably), and died 27 MAR 1907 in Dry Knob, Laclede Co., MO. She married Job BARNETT 18 JUL 1839 in Clark Co., OH, son of Job BARNETT and Mary MILLER. He was born
2 CONC  11 NOV 1817 in Bolton, Chittendon Co., VT, and died 12 MAR 1853 in Clay Co., IL. She married Johnson FURR  29 AUG 1854 in Clay Co., IL, son of French FURR and Mary "Polly" JONES. He was born 1822 in KY, and died 21 AUG 1865 in La
2 CONC clede Co, MO. She married Nelson BERRY 15 AUG 1867 in Laclede Co., MO. He was born 1817-1820 in Hampshire Co., VA (now WVA), and died 1869 in Laclede Co., MO. 	
2 CONT 	iv.	William TALIAFERRO  was born 31 OCT 1823 in OH, and died 14 MAY 1847.	
2 CONT 	v.	Sarah Jane TALIAFERRO  was born 1 OCT 1825 in OH, and died 17 DEC 1855. She married John H. TODD  14 DEC 1843 in Clark Co., OH. He was born ABT 1823. 	
2 CONT 	vi.	Emelia TALIAFERRO  was born 1 FEB 1828 in OH. She married William TOWNSLEY  24 OCT 1848 in Clark Co., OH. He was born 16 APR 1826, and died 19 APR 1890 in Clay Co., IL. 	
2 CONT 	vii.	Belinda B. TALIAFERRO  was born 21 SEP 1830 in OH. She married Joseph McFarland HAINES  16 AUG 1849 in Clark Co., OH, son of Samuel HAINES and Rebecca MCFARLAND. He was born 1 OCT 1826 in Cedarville, Greene Co., OH, and died
2 CONC  27 APR 1864 in Xenia, Greene Co., OH. She married James H. GRAY AFT APR 1864. He was born ABT 1830. 	
2 CONT 	viii.	Nancy Tibbatts TALIAFERRO  was born 15 OCT 1832 in Springfield, Clark Co., OH, and died 10 MAR 1922 in Blair Twp., Clay Co., IL. She married James W. WATERBURY  29 APR 1851 in Clay Co., IL. He was born ABT 1830, and died AF
2 CONC T 1858. She married Theodore MCKNELLY 19 FEB 1863 in Louisville, Clay Co., IL, son of John MCKNELLY and Rebecca PRIDEMORE. He was born 29 JAN 1818 in Lee Co., VA, and died 30 DEC 1893 in Blair Twp., Clay Co., IL. 	
2 CONT 	ix.	James T. TALIAFERRO  was born 7 SEP 1834 in Springfield, Clark Co., OH, and died 16 MAR 1906 in Lebanon, Laclede Co, MO. He married Annie CURRY  5 MAR 1857 in Fairfield, Wayne Co., IL, daughter of John CURRY and Mary "Polly" 
2 CONC CURRY. She was born 12 FEB 1837 in England, and died 11 JAN 1913 in Ash Grove, Greene Co., MO. 	
2 CONT 	x.	Townsley TALIAFERRO  was born 26 NOV 1835 in Clermont Co., OH, and died 22 MAY 1855 in Clay Co., IL. He married never MARRIED . 	
2 CONT 	xi.	Eliza J. TALIAFERRO was born 7 SEP 1839 in OH, and died 20 JUL 1860. She married Benjamin B. THOMAS  26 SEP 1854 in Clay Co., IL. He was born ABT 1841. 	
2 CONT 	xii.	America TALIAFERRO was born 20 AUG 1841 in OH, and died 23 AUG 1855 in Clay Co., IL.
