1 NOTE {geni:about_me} William Chenoweth Wortham, the son of Charles Wortham and Lucretia Hackley, was born December 25, 1799. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the husband of Eliza Comptom Briscoe, the daughter of Stephen Briscoe and Sarah Hobbs. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of Charles Wortham, who was born on November 2, 1824. 
2 CONT
2 CONT William Chenoweth Wortham died on October 7, 1885 and was buried in the Thomas Cemetery in Leitchfield, Grayson County, Kentucky. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His widow Eliza joined him there after her death on September 30, 1887. their son Charles was also buried in the Thomas Cemetery.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;GRid=45306251 Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 5 2017, 16:34:51 UTC''
