2 CONT On July 6, 1870 George W. & Elizabeth Maberry, ages 40 & 35, lived in Prairie Township, Newton Co, AR. He farmed to support the family & had real-estate valued at $250. Their children were Susan, age 15; Mary, 14; Simon A., 9; Dav
2 CONC id, 8; William A., 5; Rebecca J., 2; & John N., 3 months.
2 CONT
2 CONT In June 1880,
2 CONT George & Lizabeth Mabery, ages 51 & 44, lived in White Township, Newton Co, AR where he was still farming. Their children were Susan, age 25; Mary, 23; Siman, 21; David, 18; William, 16; Becky, 12; John, 10; Nancy, 8; Abram, 7; Th
2 CONC omas, 5; Florence, 3; & Columbus, 11 months. Florance & George Modux, ages 5 & 2, were also members of their family.
2 CONT
2 CONT George died in Newton Co, AR on Feb. 10, 1885. Elizabeth died the following year on Jan. 11, 1896.
