2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT In 1846 was ordained to preach the gospel. He had the pastoral care of the following churches, Glenns&apos; creek, Versailles, Great Crossings, Providence and Mt. Vernon. He also taught in Georgetown College for a term of years. H
2 CONC e died suddenly of heart disease at the house of one of the members of his church at Mt. Vernon in the dead hour of night with the abstract of the sermon he intended to preach the next morning on his table at his bedside. We have 
2 CONC a obituary article that talks about his death, dated April 26 1882.  http://www.geocities.com/baptist_documents/elkhorn.bios.html
