2 CONT A physician and professor in Richmond,Virginia.He was educated at Transylvania University, Kentucky. He graduated M.D., March 4, 1847.Married Margaretta G.
2 CONT Mitchell on November 4,1850. He practiced in Franklin County, Kentucky until 1852 when he located in Richmond, Virginia.He served in the CSA as Assistant Surgeon, 21st Virginia Infantry,and later as surgeon of same regiment, and a
2 CONC lso of the 3rd Georgia Infantry. He was also the surgeon in charge of Winder Hospital 
2 CONT and of Stuart Hospital, Richmond, 1864. He was a member of the State Board of Medical Examiners. He was a communicant of the 2nd Presbyterian Church. 
