1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=22144089 Find A Grave Memorial# 22144089]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Cloud Thrasher was the son of Isaac Cloud Thrasher and Ruth Barton. He was born 1787 in South Carolina. He married Mary Ann Evans and moved to Tennessee by 1810. In 1814 he came to Alabama as part of the Tennessee Militia, co
2 CONC mmanded by Andrew Jackson, and fought in the Battle of Horseshoe Bend. He returned to Tennessee and moved to Alabama by 1818 after the Indian lands were opened to settlers
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT John Cloud Thrasher was the son of Isaac Cloud Thrasher and Ruth Barton. He was born 1787 in South Carolina. He married Mary Ann Evans and moved to Tennessee by 1810. In 1814 he came to Alabama as part of the Tennessee Militia, co
2 CONC mmanded by Andrew Jackson, and fought in the Battle of Horseshoe Bend. He returned to Tennessee and moved to Alabama by 1818 after the Indian lands were opened to settlers.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Cloud Thrasher is my 3rd great grandfather. - Patricia Thrasher Waller
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=22144089
