2 CONT Documentation: Beckley Public Library.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Beckley, U.S.A." by Harlow Warren, published 1955.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Amelia Neville Craig Beckley.  He married Jane Ann Fulton on May 1, 1811.  He was the editor of the Pittsburgh Gazette in Pittsburgh, PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Neville B. Craig wrote a book, "Sketch of the Life and Services of Isaac Craig, Major in the Fourth (Usually Called Proctor's) Regiment of Artillery, During the Revolutionary War" about the military exploits of his father.
