2 CONC a Case, Simpson M, Nancy J Hutson, Rosella Everman, Catherine Bartles and Daniel T Battershell, DVM. William and Elizabeth are buried on a farm on a 65 square foot plot East of Thomasboro, North of Blue Mound, In Champaign County 
2 CONC Illinois.
