1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Robert Smith and Abigail (Rector) Smith. Wife of Joseph Atchley Jr, whom she married circa 1816 in Clark County, Kentucky.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of twelve, the following of whom are known to have survived until adulthood: Abigail (Atchley) Wilhelm, Priscilla (Atchley) Butler-Guinn, Elijah Atchley, Robert Smith Atchley, William Atchley, John "Jack" Riley Atchley, Geo
2 CONC rge Washington Atchley, Daniel Atchley, Noah Rector Atchley, and Joseph Alexander "Alex" Atchley.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her death date and place of burial are not known. Died in Meigs County after the Oct 1850 Census enumeration. The most probable place of her burial in an unmarked grave is the Pisgah Cemetery, given the strong Atchley family ties 
2 CONC associated with this graveyard.
2 CONT
