1 NOTE !BIRTH - VIRGINIA GENEALOGIES by Horace E. Hayden, p. 443
2 CONT Hon. Richard Cassius Lee Moncure was born at "Clermont," Dec. 11, 1805, the son of John Moncure and his wife, Alice Peachy Gaskins.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid
2 CONT He married Dec. 29, 1825 Mary Butler Washington Conway.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He died August 24, 1882.
2 CONT
2 CONT Judge Moncure was for forty years a vestryman of St. George Parish, Fredericksburg, and a lay deputy to the Dioscesan Council of VA., 1864. He was President Judge VA. Court of Appeals, 1852-1864.  Received honorary degree LL.D., W
2 CONC ashington & Lee University, 1872. - Ibid
