2 CONT An Owner of Montpelier
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Wood Moncure (1800-1866) was a merchant from Richmond. In 1842, he was deeded 750 acres under the condition that the title to the property would remain unencumbered. The agreement also allowed Moncure to rent a portion of th
2 CONC e house for three years until final payments had been made.
