1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 12 children of Lucy Brockenbrough and Daingerfield Lewis:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Jane Brockenbrough Lewis, b. Sep. 20, 1810, m. her cousin, George Washington Lewis of "Claymont" Westmoreland county, son of Samuel Lewis and Sarah Attaway Miller.
2 CONT
2 CONT Judge Lewis was married twice, once to Jane Brockenbrough Lewis (1810-1489) and second to Lucy Anne Robb (1823-1891).
2 CONT
2 CONT He had eight children. By his first wife he had
2 CONT
2 CONT # Anna Louisa Lewis (1830-1897),
2 CONT # Henry B. Lewis (1831- 1862 killed at the Battle of Seven Pines),
2 CONT # Dr. Thomas M. Lewis (1833-1910),
2 CONT # Samuel Lewis (1836-1849),
2 CONT # Robert Byrd Lewis (1841-1897), and
2 CONT # Lucy Pratt Lewis Funsten (1844-1909).
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT *Info added @ Mary S Lockwood's "Lineage Book of the Charter Members" of the DAR 
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/35859497/lucy-brockenbrough-lewis
2 CONT * “Lewis of Warner Hall: The History of a Family, Including the Genealogy of ...” Page 179.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=yeWgvfDpwbwC&lpg=PA126&vq=Baylis&pg=PA179#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks] 
