1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/93504475/angela-lewis-conrad
2 CONT
2 CONT Angela Lewis Conrad was the Infant daughter of Charles Magill & Mary Eliza Angela (Lewis) Conrad, and Great-Granddaughter of Martha Dandridge Custis Washington. and Granddaughter of Lawrence and Eleanor Parke (Custis) Lewis.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/about/K88J-4RK
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Angela Lewis
2 CONT When Angela Lewis Conrad was born on 17 March 1836, in New Orleans, Orleans, Louisiana, United States, her father, Senator Charles Magill Conrad, was 31 and her mother, Mary Eliza Angela Lewis, was 22. She died on 25 March 1837, i
2 CONC n her hometown, at the age of 1, and was buried in Mount Vernon, Fairfax County, Virginia, United States.
