1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lucy Elizabeth Payne Packett (Washington)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/18932393/lucy_elizabeth-packett
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Jul. 2, 1823 Harewood Jefferson County West Virginia, USA
2 CONT Death: 	Apr. 14, 1882 Charles Town Jefferson County West Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucy Washington Packett was the eldest child & daughter of 5 children born to Dr. Samuel Walter Washington by his wife Louisa Clemson, daughter of Thomas Green Clemson by his wife Elizabeth Baker & Sister to Thomas Greene Clemson,
2 CONC  Jr. founder of Clemson, South Carolina. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT *Samuel Walter Washington (1798 - 1831)
2 CONT *Louisa Clemson Washington (1805 - 1882)
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT *Lucy Elizabeth Washington Packett (1823 - 1882)
2 CONT *George Lafayette Washington (1825 - 1872)*
2 CONT *Christian Maria Washington Washington (1826 - 1895)*
2 CONT *Annie Steptoe Clemson Washington Brown (1831 - 1911)*
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial:
2 CONT
2 CONT Zion Episcopal Churchyard  Charles Town Jefferson County West Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Spotsgenie Record added: Jan 30, 2015  Find A Grave Memorial # 141995955
