1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Youngest son of George Fayette and Maria Frame Washington. Burwell has a monument of his own and also has an inscription on the family obelisk. His name is spelt wrong on the family stone "Burrell" instead of "Burw
2 CONC ell" as it should be. 
