2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Pvt. (USA), Prince William Washington''' was born in December 1841, in Greene, New York, United States, Greene, NY, United States. He was a Coal Miner. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992529 Annie Vandervener Vandervener Or Van De Val]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992537 G N Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992528 Regina L. Smith] in 1870, in Putnam, West Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992534 Elizia Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992533 John Washington]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992531 Mary Katherine Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854886 Lelia Ann Harmon] on October 23, 1882, in Putnam, West Virginia, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992532 Jesse Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992535 Nelson Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854891 Francis Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854887 Mary Katherine Hall];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854885 William Edgar Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854884 Minnie E Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759992536 George H Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854888 Clarence Milton Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854889 Beulah Nanny Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34759854890 Trula Ethel Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34757572376 Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on April 10, 1909, in Putnam County, West Virginia, USA and was buried in Big Cherry Cemetery, Putnam County, West Virginia, USA. : [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/161755921/prince-william-washington Find A Grave Memo
2 CONC rial] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Military'''
2 CONT
2 CONT All Union Records for Prince and or William Washington Birth year 1841 Died 1909. Putnam County, W VA. in Ancestry.com only came up with one Prince Washington-  In the Union Army there were two soldiers named Prince Washington abo
2 CONC ut the same age. One served in the colored army, not this Prince Washington. See Below. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Civil War information. Two Prince Washington's on record- Ancestry.com only has the Colored guard - not this Prince Washington- he was in the 11th Virginia Infantry, Company F. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Prince William Washington  Civil War 1861 to 1864, 4 years, 11 months
2 CONT * 11th Virginia Infantry
2 CONT * Company "F" (Preston Guards)
2 CONT * The Preston Guards, guarded the railroads.
