1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Francis (Frank) Augustine Washington, Jr.''' was born on August 25, 1845, in Teays Valley, Putnam, WV, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-26034794 Francis Augustine Washington, Sr.] and [https://www.g
2 CONC eni.com/profile-34649806145 Melvina M Washington]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis (Frank) married [https://www.geni.com/profile-25989160 Lucy Joanna Washington] on October 21, 1868 in United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26033607 Ladonia Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26033699 Oliver Franklin Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26033754 Edith Leander];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26033801 Mae Forester Hodges];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26033867 Lillie Gillispie];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26033928 Ocie Gaynelle Bowen];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-25975003 Oscar Otho Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26033997 Luther Washington];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-26033468 Ora Grant]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 2, 1913, in Putnam, WV, United States and was buried after November 2, 1913, in Fraziers Bottom, Putnam County, West Virginia, United States of America. 
