1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born in Warren Co TN. Died at Wilderness, Oregon Co MO. The son of Thomas James and Nancy Moreland Simpson. Married first Mary 'Jane' Coole Farrell 05 Sep 1841 in TN. Children were Richard L., Thomas M., Nancy, Joh
2 CONC n C., Lucinda, Sarah Jane and William G. Simpson. Married second Mrs. Eleanor Falkenberry, a widow with children, on 24 Jul 1855 at Oregon Co MO. Children were: James W., Martha M., Jesse W., Peter Lemuel and Margaret Simpson.  Ma
2 CONC rried third Serena Boze 04 Jun 1877 at Oregon Co MO. No children of this marriage. Married last, Emaline Brown (Reaser, Bockman, Barnett) 15 Aug 1878 at Oregon Co MO. She is buried at Spring Creek Cemetery in Oregon Co MO. No chil
2 CONC dren of this marriage.
2 CONT
