1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Name mystery
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT Charles F. Chilton is on his headstone Charles Thomas Chilton is referenced in sources. Thomas Chilton is referenced in the census. What to believe? Maybe it's Charles F. Thomas Chilton?
2 CONT
2 CONT Location mystery
2 CONT -----------------
2 CONT Still unknown why he moved to Tippecanoe county in Indiana. I believe it was because of promised land that was good for farming though. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife Mystery
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT It's also unknown if Jane Ransdall Vories was his wife or not, that's linked, but she is the closest thing I've seen to being accurate. Except for her date of birth is off 5 years. Should be 1811. Also her name wouldn't have been 
2 CONC spelled like Ransdall. I KNOW it would have been Ransdell. The Ransdell's and Chilton's came from Virginia together to the Chilton farm in Kentucky and multiple Ransdell's are in Chilton Cemetery #1. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I believe her name to be Martha Susan "Jane" Ransdell, somebody I've seen in references. She was born in 1811 and I do not know on the death date, yet* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/79398952/charles-f._thomas-chi
2 CONC lton Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 21 2021, 3:48:18 UTC''
