2 CONT
2 CONT Fought at the battles of Lawrence, Kansas August 21, 1863 and Independence, Mo. August 11, 1861. He was a pallbearer for Jesse James second funeral in 1902 and he attended all the "William C. Quantrill" reunions as did his brother
2 CONC , John Hicks George.
