2 CONT WARREN, John L. b: Dec 22 1844, Missouri d: Mar 5 1886 bur: Mar 6 1886 Mullin Cemetery, White Oak Twp, Henry Co, MO Clinton MO, 1886 - In the death of John L. Warren, White Oak township loses a most estimable citizen and well-to-d
2 CONC o farmer. He died March 5, 1886 and was buried on the 6th by the Masons.  (Obit copied from Henry Co website.)
