2 CONT Hi, Sandra.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thank you for all you have contributed to Find A Grave.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Pearsons are distant relatives to me. I noticed that Mary Frances Hawkins'
2 CONT marriages in her bio notes are reversed as far as first and second husbands.
2 CONT
2 CONT I took the liberty to rewrite the notes for her to correct the wording and list
2 CONT children by her husbands in order of their births. I hope they meet with your
2 CONT approval.
2 CONT
2 CONT Please replace Mary's bio notes with this:
2 CONT ==
2 CONT Mary Francis Hawkins was the daughter of Strother Moses Hawkins and Francis
2 CONT Lucinda Reno.
2 CONT Mary first married Micajah Woods HARRIS on 18 Jun 1867 in Bonham, Texas. Their
2 CONT children were:
2 CONT James Harris
2 CONT Ida Joella Harris
2 CONT Margaret F. Harris
2 CONT Micajah W. Harris, Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married second Philip Perry Pearson on 20 Sep 1879 in Bonham, Texas. Their
2 CONT children were:
2 CONT Tom Thumb Pearson
2 CONT Myrtle Oliver Pearson
2 CONT Joseph Finnimore II Pearson
2 CONT Philip Edgar Pearson
2 CONT ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Thank you for attending to this update.
2 CONT
2 CONT Best regards,
2 CONT Robert Daniell
