1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was the daughter of William B. & Nancy Jane (Cunningham) Wilmott.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her father died when she was seven and her mother died when she was 15. She went to live with the Thomas Wherritt family. She made her home there until she married.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married George O. Parrott, 14 Jan 1892, Cass County, Missouri.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the mother of seven children;
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Infant Daughter b-1892
2 CONT 2. Vera E. b-1895
2 CONT 3. Lou Ella b-28 May 1898
2 CONT 4. G. Harold b-1902
2 CONT 5. Mary b-16 Oct 1903
2 CONT 6. Wilmott J. b-
2 CONT 7. Juanita b-11 Mar 1913
2 CONT
