0 @N6000000003615408645@ NOTE N1362 [ Mary BALL] 
1 CONT When Mary's mother died in 1721, she was sent to live with her guardian, Col. George Eskridge, of Sandy Point, where she remained until she married Augustine Washington. Her first born child, George, was named after her guardian, 
1 CONC and George Washington became the first President of the United States.
