1 CONT 1. MONTGOMERY8 HERRELL (WILLIAM7 HARRELL, WILLIAM6, JACOB5, JOHN4 HARROLD, WALTER3, RICHARD2, THOMAS1 HARRELL) was born 1823 in Evensham, Wythe Co, VA, and died Bef. 1872 in Claiborne Co, TN. He married (1) PERTILLA "MATILDA" BROO
1 CONC KS 06 Dec 1846 in Claiborne Co, TN, daughter of ARMSTEAD BROOKS and NANCY HARRISON. She was born 1825 in Claiborne Co, TN. He married (2) MARY E. REESE 23 Nov 1859 in Tazewell, Claiborne Co, TN, daughter of ISIAH REESE and SARAH _
1 CONC ____. She was born 1840 in Jefferson Co, TN.
1 CONT
1 CONT 1850 Claiborne Co, TN census Montgomery (Brooks?) Herrell 25 TN b. 1824-1825; 27 Sep 1850.
1 CONT 1860 Claiborne Co, TN census Mont Herrell 37 TN b. 1822-1823; Tazewell, pg 96; 1 Jun 1860. Spouse listed as Mary E. age 20 with a 12 year old son named James. Rachael age 3 Female which some researchers may have believed to be Ric
1 CONC hard. No Richard listed. Living near uncle John Hurst.
