1 CONT This family may be traced back two additional generations, if you are interested. One source indicates that Nancy Cornelia Herrell and James Thomas Parker were first cousins and that their mothers, Elizabeth and Pertilla Brooks we
1 CONC re sisters. We have not verified this information yet, but it seems to make sense to me. For some reason the descendants of Montgomery Herrell spelled their name Herrell rather than Harrell. His brother, George Washington Herrell,
1 CONC  (my ancestor) also spelled the name Herrell.
